 type="input"><value>//sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H5f71c3cfb4064b51bb458d0a786cb402R/286385890/H5f71c3cfb4064b51bb458d0a786cb402R.jpg</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="gallery" type="singleCheck"><value displayName="Packaging &amp; shipping specifications">700</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="textDesc" type="input"><value>Slip-on moc-toe shoes with double tassels, visible toe stitching and embossed surface texture. The actual photographs show five separate rubber contact pads and a small rear heel extension. Rubber outsole, PU lining and glued construction are specified by the source. Upper, midsole and insole compositions are not specified. Source colors are Red, Light Brown and Blue, with listed size labels 38-44; the Brown SKU corresponds to the pictured Light Brown shade. Fit and international size conversion are confirmed for the order. Send color-size quantities, destination, packing requirements and requested dispatch date for an order-specific quotation. No slip-resistance test, driving safety, handmade construction or ready-stock claim is made.</value></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. supports footwear wholesale inquiries. The company capability images below describe general business capabilities. Product-specific supply, samples, customization, packing and dispatch are assessed against your order requirements before quotation.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What materials and construction are specified?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The source specifies a rubber outsole, PU lining and glued construction. Upper, midsole and insole compositions are not specified. Send additional material requirements with your inquiry for order-specific confirmation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colors and sizes can I request?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Source colors are Red, Light Brown and Blue, with listed size labels 38-44. The Brown SKU is the pictured Light Brown shade. Specify each color-size quantity; measured fit and international size conversion are confirmed for the order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What sole and upper details are shown?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Actual photos show separate rubber contact pads, a small rear heel extension, a slip-on opening, moc-toe stitching, embossed texture and double tassels. Driving moccasins describes the shoe style; no driving safety or tested grip performance is claimed.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What are the minimum and quantity prices?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative unit prices are USD 16.80 for 2-49 pairs, USD 15.68 for 50-99 pairs and USD 14.56 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on color-size mix, packing, destination and agreed terms; freight and taxes are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I request samples or customization?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send the sample quantity, requested colors and any logo or packing requirements. Feasibility, applicable minimums, sample charges and customization options are assessed before quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Are stock and dispatch guaranteed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>No ready-stock or fixed dispatch promise is made. Provide quantities, destination, packing and requested dispatch date. Supply, per-size availability, payment terms and dispatch arrangements are confirmed during inquiry.</value></field></complex-values></field></itemSchema>